{
  "name": "AI Business Workflow Automation System - 客户需求自动处理",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "errorWorkflow": "errorHandlerMain"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "customer-inbox",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "binaryData": false,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-webhook-inbound",
      "name": "① 表单/Webhook 接收",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "customer-inbox"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=请作为企业客户服务主管，对以下客户进线内容做意图分析。\n\n客户姓名：{{ $json.body.name || $json.body.customer_name || '未知' }}\n联系方式：{{ $json.body.contact || $json.body.email || '未知' }}\n来源渠道：{{ $json.body.source || '官网表单' }}\n原始内容：\n{{ $json.body.message || $json.body.content || $json.body.text || JSON.stringify($json.body) }}\n\n请输出 JSON，严格包含以下字段：\n- intent：客户真实诉求（一句话概括）\n- sentiment：客户情绪，取值 positive / neutral / negative / angry\n- urgency：紧急程度，取值 low / medium / high / critical\n- expectedAction：希望企业采取的下一步动作",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是企业客户成功中心的分析助手。只输出 JSON，不要解释。判断要基于客户原话，不要编造。"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-llm-analyze",
      "name": "② LLM 需求分析",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        40,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=请把以下客户进线内容，归入且仅归入一个业务分类。\n\n客户原始内容：\n{{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.message || $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.content || JSON.stringify($('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body) }}\n分析结果：{{ $json }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是企业工单分类器。分类必须从以下枚举中选一个：sales_inquiry（售前咨询）、after_sales（售后/退换货）、tech_support（技术支持）、billing（账单/付款）、partnership（商务合作）、complaint（投诉）、other（其他）。只输出 JSON。"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-ai-classify",
      "name": "③ AI 智能分类",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        280,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schema": {
          "attributes": {
            "intent": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "客户真实诉求一句话概括"
            },
            "sentiment": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "情绪：positive/neutral/negative/angry"
            },
            "urgency": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "紧急程度：low/medium/high/critical"
            },
            "expectedAction": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "希望企业下一步做什么"
            },
            "category": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "业务分类：sales_inquiry/after_sales/tech_support/billing/partnership/complaint/other"
            }
          }
        },
        "format": "json"
      },
      "id": "node-structured-output",
      "name": "结构化结果解析",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        280,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=请用不超过 60 个汉字，为这条客户工单生成一段摘要，便于负责人在飞书通知里快速扫读。\n\n客户：{{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').first().json.body.name || '未知' }}\n分类：{{ $json.category }}\n情绪：{{ $json.sentiment }}\n紧急度：{{ $json.urgency }}\n诉求：{{ $json.intent }}\n期望动作：{{ $json.expectedAction }}\n\n知识库检索到的相关政策片段（仅作背景参考，不要照抄）：\n{{ ($('知识库检索（RAG）').first()?.json?.top_k || []).map(x => x.content).join('；').slice(0, 300) || '无' }}\n\n输出就是摘要正文，不要加前缀。",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是工单摘要撰写人。输出就是摘要正文，不要加前缀、不要加引号、不要换行。"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-llm-summary",
      "name": "④ 自动生成摘要",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        520,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "ticket_id",
              "value": "={{ 'TK-' + $now.format('yyyyMMdd') + '-' + $execution.id.toString().slice(-6) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "customer_name",
              "value": "={{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.name || '未知' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "contact",
              "value": "={{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.contact || $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.email || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "={{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.source || '官网表单' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "raw_message",
              "value": "={{ $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.message || $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.content || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "category",
              "value": "={{ $json.category }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a7",
              "name": "intent",
              "value": "={{ $('③ AI 智能分类').item.json.intent }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a8",
              "name": "sentiment",
              "value": "={{ $('③ AI 智能分类').item.json.sentiment }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a9",
              "name": "urgency",
              "value": "={{ $('③ AI 智能分类').item.json.urgency }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a10",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.output || $json.text || $json }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a11",
              "name": "created_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a12",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "new",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-build-record",
      "name": "⑤ 生成结构化工单记录",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        760,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bitable/v1/apps/{{ $env.FEISHU_BITABLE_APP_TOKEN }}/tables/{{ $env.FEISHU_BITABLE_TABLE_ID }}/records",
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"工单号\": $json.ticket_id,\n    \"客户\": $json.customer_name,\n    \"联系方式\": $json.contact,\n    \"来源\": $json.source,\n    \"分类\": $json.category,\n    \"情绪\": $json.sentiment,\n    \"紧急度\": $json.urgency,\n    \"SLA等级\": $json.sla_level,\n    \"SLA时限\": $json.sla_time,\n    \"摘要\": $json.summary,\n    \"原始内容\": $json.raw_message,\n    \"状态\": $json.status,\n    \"创建时间\": {{ $now.format('x') }}\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "retryOnFail": true
        }
      },
      "id": "node-sync-feishu",
      "name": "⑥ 同步飞书多维表格",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=user_id",
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"receive_id\": \"{{ $env.FEISHU_OWNER_USER_ID }}\",\n  \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n  \"content\": JSON.stringify({\n    config: { wide_screen_mode: true },\n    header: {\n      template: $json.urgency === 'critical' ? 'red' : ($json.urgency === 'high' ? 'orange' : 'blue'),\n      title: { tag: 'plain_text', content: '新客户工单 ' + $json.ticket_id + ' [' + $json.sla_level + ']' }\n    },\n    elements: [\n      { tag: 'div', text: { tag: 'lark_md', content: '**分类：**' + $json.category + '\\n**紧急度：**' + $json.urgency + '\\n**情绪：**' + $json.sentiment + '\\n**客户：**' + $json.customer_name + '（' + $json.contact + '）' } },\n      { tag: 'hr' },\n      { tag: 'div', text: { tag: 'lark_md', content: '**AI 摘要：**\\n' + $json.summary } },\n      { tag: 'div', text: { tag: 'lark_md', content: '**SLA：**' + $json.sla_level + ' · ' + $json.sla_time + ' 内响应 · 责任团队：' + $json.sla_owner } },\n      { tag: 'note', elements: [{ tag: 'plain_text', content: '来源：' + $json.source + ' · 已同步至飞书多维表格' }] }\n    ]\n  })\n}",
        "options": {
          "retryOnFail": true
        }
      },
      "id": "node-notify-owner",
      "name": "⑦ 自动通知负责人",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"message\": \"已受理\",\n  \"ticket_id\": $json.ticket_id,\n  \"category\": $json.category,\n  \"summary\": $json.summary\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-respond",
      "name": "受理回执",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "={{ $env.LLM_MODEL || 'gpt-4o-mini' }}",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "node-chat-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model（分析/分类）",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        120,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "={{ $env.LLM_MODEL || 'gpt-4o-mini' }}",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      "id": "node-chat-model-summary",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model（摘要）",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.KB_SEARCH_URL }}?q={{ encodeURIComponent($('③ AI 智能分类').item.json.intent || $('① 表单/Webhook 接收').item.json.body.message) }}&top_k=3",
        "method": "GET",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": false,
        "sendBody": false,
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "retryOnFail": true
        }
      },
      "id": "node-kb-search",
      "name": "知识库检索（RAG）",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// SLA 矩阵：分类 × 紧急度 → 响应时限 / 负责人团队\nconst SLAs = {\n  //            low                 medium              high                critical\n  sales_inquiry:{level:'P4',time:'24h', team:'销售部'},\n  after_sales:  {level:'P3',time:'8h',  team:'售后部'},\n  tech_support: {level:'P3',time:'4h',  team:'技术支持'},\n  billing:      {level:'P3',time:'4h',  team:'财务部'},\n  partnership:  {level:'P4',time:'24h', team:'商务部'},\n  complaint:    {level:'P2',time:'2h',  team:'客户成功'},\n  other:        {level:'P4',time:'24h', team:'客服中心'},\n};\nconst U = { low:0, medium:1, high:2, critical:3 };\nconst urgent = { 'high': {level:'P2',time:'1h'}, 'critical': {level:'P1',time:'30min'} };\nconst cat = $json.category || 'other';\nconst urg = $json.urgency || 'low';\nconst base = SLAs[cat] || SLAs.other;\nlet sla = base;\nif (U[urg] >= 2) sla = Object.assign({}, base, urgent[urg]);\n// 特殊：投诉 + 高/紧急 一律 P1\nif (cat === 'complaint' && U[urg] >= 2) sla = {level:'P1', time:'30min', team:'客户成功+主管'};\nif (cat === 'tech_support' && urg === 'critical') sla = {level:'P1', time:'30min', team:'技术支持+主管'};\n$json.sla_level = sla.level;\n$json.sla_time = sla.time;\n$json.sla_owner = sla.team;\nreturn $json;"
      },
      "id": "node-sla-matrix",
      "name": "SLA 矩阵（28 组合）",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        440
      ]
    }
  ],
